        "id": 6281,
        "name": "Greonhal",
        "username": "Greonhal",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/g/bb73d2/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2012-09-13T08:19:33.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>After getting my Infernal Relics expansion at PAX, I pulled the cards out, put them in the Enhanced box and just let the box sit next to Rook City and the original box for a while. I didn't want to throw them out, because I love the art on them, but I had no real use for them, either. As we all know, they're pretty terrible for actually holding cards. So, I came up with a solution. I drilled holes in the back of the box, put in some screws--held in place by nuts--and wrapped a short length of wire around the screws.</p><p>![Clipped Apostate's wing, too. Take that, guy.](upload://yOOxZSdPo31FQoMZGuQTxD3Wtva.png)</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>That way, I was able to hang them up on my wall with a certain amount of artful placement, just for fun.</p><p>![Rook City is farthest from the light. How appropriate.](upload://yOOxZSdPo31FQoMZGuQTxD3Wtva.png)</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>No longer taking up space, and I get to enjoy the art on them. Victory!</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-13T16:04:36.617Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
